{"question_id": "kaoyan_math3_1987_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math3_1987", "exam_type": "math3", "year": 1987, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 2, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["可导性", "导数"], "methods": [], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math3_1987_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math3_1987_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/answer_pages/page_001.png"], "stem": "若函数$f(x)$在区间$(a,b)$内可导，$x_1$和$x_2$是区间$(a,b)$内任意两点，\n且$x_1 < x_2$，则至少存在一点$\\xi$，使（ ）\n\nA. $f(b) - f(a) = f'(\\xi)(b - a)$，其中$a < \\xi < b$．\n\nB. $f(b) - f(x_1) = f'(\\xi)(b - x_1)$，其中$x_1 < \\xi < b$．\n\nC. $f(x_2) - f(x_1) = f'(\\xi)(x_2 - x_1)$，其中$x_1 < \\xi < x_2$．\n\nD. $f(x_2) - f(a) = f'(\\xi)(x_2 - a)$，其中$a < \\xi < x_2$．", "answer": "C", "explanation": "答案为 C。解析见下方答案解析页图；PDF 文本层公式不稳定，未直接转写为 LaTeX。"}
